      "snippet": {
        "line": 164,
        "text": "theorem compact_chart_count (A : ℝ) (hB : IsCompact B) : ∃ C > 0, ∀ n : ℕ, 1 ≤ n → (relevantLabels n A B).Finite ∧ ((relevantLabels n A B).ncard : ℝ) ≤ C * ChartScales.S n ^ 9"
